# NOTICE — sv-parser submodule

This package uses a git submodule at `crates/sv-parser/` pointing at
[https://github.com/etcimon/sv-parser.git](https://github.com/etcimon/sv-parser.git) branch/pin `g6lc` (HEAD `977cb3f51e00ebd04322c8c75f1d63472030f3a6`).

That tree is a fork of [dalance/sv-parser](https://github.com/dalance/sv-parser)
(dalance/sv-parser v0.13.5). It is a **Rust** SystemVerilog parser (IEEE 1800 CST). It is
**not** a Python parser, pyslang, or slang.

